                    (/var/folders/.../rdv-orig-ms-eRObR9/node_modules/ms), probed 2026-06-23.
                    Behaviors confirmed by execution; NOTE the task hint had two inaccuracies that the
                    live run corrected: unparseable strings return undefined (NOT NaN), and a >100-char
                    string returns undefined (NOT a throw). The SIR documents the verified behavior.
